一、选词填空（每题1分）
1. ___encryption transforms plaintext into ciphertext.        (encryption / decryption)
2. A ___symmetric uses the same key for encryption and decryption. (symmetric / asymmetric)
3. The ___private key must remain secret.                 (public / private)
4. A ___worm spreads without a host file.              (virus / worm)
5. ___Authentication verifies who you are.                       (Authentication / Authorization)
6. ___Authorization decides what you can do.                    (Authentication / Authorization)
7. The firewall sits at the network ___perimeter.           (perimeter / payload)
8. A ___certificate binds a public key to an identity.        (certificate / cipher)

二、判断正误（每题1分）
9.  对称加密用不同密钥加解密。           ( F )
10. 数字签名提供不可否认性。             ( T )
11. 公钥可以自由分发。                   ( T )
12. WAF 工作在网络层。                   ( F )

三、连词/介词（每题1分）
13. Computing the private key from the public key is computationally infeasible __from_ the public key.  (from / in)
14. Access control ensures only authorized users can access ___to specific resources.  (to / of)
